{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00394","headline":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 告谢 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 告谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得一流玄泽，通三御紫宸。\n远叶千龄运，遐销九域尘。\n绝瑞骈阗集，殊祥络绎臻。\n登年庆栖亩，稔岁贺盈囷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}